    "body": "I haven't figured out a good way to test this in implementations yet.  I do know that at least Gecko runs these steps sync from setting data:, not off a task; I don't know what other impls do.\n\nIt's possible that running these steps sync but the events off a task is black-box equivalent to running the steps async and the events sync....\n",
