    "body": "@bzbarsky per the specification they use different task sources, so ordering between `postMessage()` and `<object>` is not guaranteed. (Not sure why `<object>` only uses the \"DOM manipulation task source\" though as it seemingly suggests. Would expect the networking task source to be involved at least, so there's probably bugs there too.)\n",
